      "description": "Runs a `test-plan/v1` against a system under test: resolves the plan, binds its test data (fixed and reviewed, or generated from template + params + seed, per `vm6m`), executes every case or skips it with a reason, and writes the `folio-test-run/v1` and the `test-report/v1`. UNTAINTED from the system under test — never the same actor — and it does not certify: the rollup it writes is what the certifier decides ON. Bean `3o5b`.",
